		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A human-sized snake with scales made of jewels and a corona of iridescent feathers.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 42, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 bite +6 (2d6 + poison), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 9</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Change Shape</strong>. In place of attacks, transform into any similarly-sized creature.</p><p></p><p><strong>Poison</strong>. CON 15+ or fall into natural, deep sleep for 1d8 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Restore</strong>. In place of attacks, touch one creature to remove a curse, affliction, or heal 3d8 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
